        "If the exam is passed, the course is considered passed and the process can continue.",
        "If the exam is passed, the course is considered passed. If the exam is failed, another sign-up for the exam is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the pass condition, course completion status, and process termination. The second span is a direct restatement covering the same positive outcome."
    },
    {
